# Third-party SPICE models are NOT redistributed with this repository.
#
# Files here are fetched at run time by each simulation's run.sh. Every model
# still gets a row in ../MODELS_PROVENANCE.csv recording its source, licence and
# redistribution status, even though the file itself is absent from git.
#
# Original models authored for this project belong in ../models/ or ../va/,
# which are tracked normally.
*
!.gitignore
